# Bennett Nahida Furina Xingqiu. ~22s Rot. Bennett Burgeon Vape with Furina & Xingqiu. Fanfare generation drops after the first rotation; Bennett recieves all healing. Noticeably better survivability than other 2x Hydro options.

# Team - Options listed by DPS
bennett char lvl=90/90 cons=6 talent=9,9,9;
